BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Magical Cirque Christmas
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261201T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261201T213000
UID:bat-202612011930-a-magical-cirque-christmas@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Bring the whole family for a night of breathtaking variety 
 acts and holiday magic! For more than five spectacular holiday seasons\, A
  Magical Cirque Christmas has captivated fans and welcomed families\, maki
 ng it part of their seasonal celebrations.
LOCATION:IU Auditorium
URL:https://www.iuauditorium.com/events/detail/a-magical-cirque-christmas-
 2026
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sarah Jarosz: 10 Years of Undercurrent
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261203T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261203T210000
UID:bat-202612031900-sarah-jarosz-10-years-of-undercurrent@bloomingtonarts
 .today
DESCRIPTION:$. Originally from Wimberley\, Texas\, Sarah Jarosz is a six-t
 ime GRAMMY Award winning singer\, songwriter and multi-instrumentalist. \n
 \nJordan Tice is an award-winning guitarist and songwriter described by th
 e Fretboard Journal as “quite simply\, one of our favorite acoustic guit
 arists performing today.”
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/sarah-jarosz-10-years-of-undercurren
 t-december-3-2026/
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
