DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261205T180000
UID:bat-202612051600-the-singing-hoosiers-present-holiday-chi@bloomingtona
 rts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Ring in the season with one of Bloomington’s most beloved
  holiday traditions as the Singing Hoosiers return to the IU Auditorium st
 age for Holiday Chimes. This festive celebration blends timeless carols\, 
 contemporary favorites\, and dazzling choreography into a performance fill
 ed with warmth and joy.
LOCATION:IU Auditorium
URL:https://www.iuauditorium.com/events/detail/chimes-2026
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
