SUMMARY:The ConstelLate Show: Holiday Special
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261217T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261217T213000
UID:bat-202612171930-the-constellate-show-holiday-special@bloomingtonarts.
 today
DESCRIPTION:$. The ConstelLate Show is Constellation’s very own late-nig
 ht holiday special—part talk show\, part variety show\, and completely o
 ne-of-a-kind. Running throughout the holidays with brand-new guests each n
 ight\, this festive evening brings together local luminaries\, performers\
 , and personalities. Each episode features interviews\, games\, live music
 \, comedy\, surprise talents\, and a few unexpected twists.
LOCATION:The Rose Firebay Theater @ Waldron Arts Center
URL:https://seeconstellation.org/event/constellate-show/
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
